  version: 0.10.0
  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24295453
  repository-code: https://github.com/chenle02/stratonovich-ham-second-moment-lean
abstract: >-
  The manuscript, its reading edition and the filtered Git history of a
  research project on the stochastic wave equation with multiplicative
  Gaussian noise, fractional in time, in the Stratonovich sense (the
  hyperbolic Anderson model) in dimensions one to three. The project
  identifies the large-time behaviour of the second moment at the scale
  t^kappa, kappa = (4 - alpha - alpha_0)/(3 - alpha), with a constant given by
  an explicit variational formula. The work was developed by Le Chen with
  his AI research system; the filtered history records the proof revisions,
  review runs, failed routes and decisions that could be published;
  REDACTIONS.md lists what was removed and why. The
  verification status of each result is in VERIFICATION.md. Text and
  manuscript are licensed CC BY 4.0; scripts and Lean code are licensed
  Apache-2.0.
keywords:
- stochastic partial differential equations
- hyperbolic Anderson model
- stochastic wave equation
- Stratonovich integral
- moment asymptotics
- intermittency
- AI-assisted mathematics
- verification
